MUSES. The nine were daughters of Zeus & Mnemosyne (-6’ziné), Memory. Their names & provinces are:—Clio, history; Melpomene (-6’mini), tragedy; Thalia (-i’a), comedy;
===
**MUSES.** The nine were daughters of Zeus & Mnemosyne (-ŏ'zĭnē), Memory. Their names & provinces are:—*Clio,* history; *Melpomene* (-ŏ'mĭnĭ), tragedy; *Thalia* (-ī'a), comedy;
